==English==

===Etymology===
{{prefix|en|dis|satisfied}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/dɪsˈsætɪsˌfaɪd/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-dissatisfied.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Feeling or displaying disappointment or a lack of contentment.
# Not [[satisfied]] (e.g. with the [[quality]] of something).
#: {{ux|en|We offer refunds to '''dissatisfied''' customers.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2020 July 29|author=Paul Stephen|title=A new collaboration centred on New Street|journal=Rail|page=54|text=The good news for '''dissatisfied''' users of Birmingham New Street is that none of these criticisms have gone unnoticed.}}

